{
  "id": "NUM.20",
  "number": "20",
  "bookId": "NUM",
  "reference": "Ekim. 20",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋakipi ŋuna a Meriba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Todolut Ŋisirael daadaŋ naloŋisat ŋina a Sin elap ŋolo ke epei, kiboiyoto ŋituŋa alo Kades. Abu Miriam totwan a nen ka tonukae nen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amam ŋakipi ŋuna emasete ŋituŋa a nen; aŋun, apotu ŋituŋa daadaŋ tocunun kisiburata Moses ka Aron. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisiburata ŋituŋa Moses temasi, “Okoe, kerae ca totwakitetei isua daŋ apaki ŋina amunyarya Ekapolon ŋiyeneta kosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaanukiro iyaunia iyoŋ ŋituŋa ke Ekapolon naloŋisat na, otwaka isua kaapei ka ŋibaren kosi a ne? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaanukiro ikiyaunia iyoŋ isua anakwap a Ijipit, nakibois na ŋina aronon nooi? Nyerae na akwap ŋina eya ŋikinyom, kori a ŋaboboryo, kori ŋikito a epiini ka ŋina emam ŋakipi ŋuna emasyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu nai Moses ka Aron toloto aneni ayai atukot a ŋituŋa, toloto lopuke ŋolo ke eema a ŋolokilipet, toryediko, todolo ŋireetin kwap, abu nai akica a Ekapolon totakanu neni kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kirwor Ekapolon neni a Moses tema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Totiŋ ebela, ido tocunakisi ka Aron Ŋisirael daadaŋ tolimok ataaba epupete ikes kitolomu ŋakipi a nen. Aŋun, itolomuni iyoŋ ŋakipi anataaba aŋuna kec. Iinakini nai iyoŋ ŋakipi neni a ŋituŋa ka ŋibaren kec.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu Moses tolemu ebela totiŋ alokiŋaren Ekapolon, ikwapei ecikitor Ekapolon iŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tonyaraut Moses ka Aron ŋituŋa iwapei diyete ataaba, tolimok Moses ikes tema, “Kiirasi iyes ŋikaŋerok, ikiinakinio isua iyes ŋakipi anataaba a na a?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A nen, kikyaa Moses akan keŋ, toram ataaba ŋin ŋarwa ŋaarei a ebela keŋ; kiyesun ŋakipi elalak nooi, tomata ŋituŋa ka ŋibaren kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai tolimok Ekapolon Moses ka Aron tema, “Aŋuna pa ikikinyomitotor iyes ayoŋ, ikotere itoodiunete apedor kaŋ ŋina asegan iteete Ŋisirael, nyeruwor iyes iyaarete ŋituŋa lu nakwap ŋina ainakinit ayoŋ ikes.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋun ŋakipi a Meriba ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20:13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Meriba",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Iŋes atemar ebura",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " neni aponiata Ŋisirael kiŋuruŋura neni a Ekapolon ka neni abunio Ekapolon kitoodiunia apedor keŋ ŋina asegan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Towounae Ŋisirael atubor anakwap a Edom",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alo Kades, abu Moses kiyakiya ŋituŋa neni ke erwosit a Edom ebala; “Ŋakiro alokaato kon a Isirael ikes nu, iyeni iyoŋ ŋatyokisyo daadaŋ ŋuna aponi isua toryamunae: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyeni iyoŋ epite ŋolo atiyaarotor atapapaa kosi Ijipit, kiboi isua alo Ijipit apaki ŋina aoyan ka apotu Ŋijipitian ikisicana isua ka atapapaa kosi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ido ani ikaloikinio isua Ekapolon, abu kiira akigworo kosi, tosodi kiyaku emalaika keŋ, ŋolo abu ikiyau isua anakwap a Ijipit, ikiya tokona isua ne Kades, lotaun ŋolo eyai lokukoru a akwap kon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikilipit tokona isua iyoŋ, kimyekinae isua totuboretei anakwap kon, nyeriyo isua lomanikor edio, kori lomanikor a ŋikito ke epiini, nyemasyo isua ŋakipi anakare ka adio, emekinio isua erot ŋolo a ŋirwosi, akitodol ŋina etuborere isua anakwap kon.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai apotu Ŋiedomi temasi, “Nyitorete iyes nakwap kosi, ani kitiyata iyes ŋun eponio isua akitijikin iyes.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimokis Ŋisirael ikes temasi, “Iwuapakinio ro isua erot bon, ido ani kemasi isua kaapei ka ŋibaren kosi ŋakipi kus, itemokino isua ikisicani a ŋun. Ekudyoko ro ŋakiro nu, kimyekinae ro iyes isua totuboretei.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Temasi Ŋiedomi, “Nyitorete iyes a nakwap kosi jik.” Apotu nai Ŋiedomi potu neni a Ŋisirael erae ajore ŋina alalan nooi, eyakatar ŋiboro ŋulu ke ejie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, apotu Ŋiedomi towout Ŋisirael akitor nakwap kec, ido apotu Ŋisirael nyitor nakwap a Ŋiedomi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Atwanare ka Aron",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Towotokis Ŋisirael daadaŋ alo Kades todolo Moru Or. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alo Moru Or a ŋolo eyai lokukoru a akwap ke Edom, kirwor Ekapolon neni a Moses ka Aron tema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Emaikina Aron totwana ikwapei atapapaa keŋ, anerae nyelomari iŋes nakwap ŋina ainak ayoŋ Ŋisirael aŋuna iponiata iyes toŋero ŋuna alimuni ayoŋ aŋuna a ŋakipi a Meriba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ya Aron ka lokoku keŋ Eleasar Moru Or; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ani edolete nen, tolacu ŋilowi aneni ka Aron, ido kitanapik neni a lokoku keŋ a Eleasar. Nai etwani Aron ikwapei atapapaa keŋ, etwani iŋes aina.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
