              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolaca Moses ŋilowi aneni ka Aron, kitanapik neni a Eleasar alokoku ka Aron, ido abu Aron totwana alokidiama emoru. Totiyaun nai Moses ka Eleasar alokidiama emoru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.28",
